<para id="RM000000FSU00TX" category="N" type-id="8009I" name-id="3225C-00" from="200612">
<name>Function Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM000000FSU00TX_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM000000FSU00TX_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___000047300000">
<ptxt>Time Lag Test</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Be sure to perform this after inspecting and adjusting the engine.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Perform the test at normal operating CVT fluid temperature (50 to 100°C).</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Perform the test with the A/C OFF.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
<s2>
<ptxt>Apply the parking brake and chock the wheels.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Start the engine.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>While depressing the brake pedal, shift from the N position to the D or R position at idle speed, and measure the time until a slight shock is felt.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Standard</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>N → D position 1.2 seconds or less</ptxt>
</specitem>
<specitem>
<ptxt>N → R position 1.5 seconds or less</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Take several measurements and use the average value.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When measuring repeatedly, allow an interval of 1 minutes.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM000000FSU00TX_01_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___000047400000">
<ptxt>Stall Speed Test</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Be sure to perform this after inspecting and adjusting the engine.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Perform the test at normal operating CVT fluid temperature (50 to 100°C).</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Perform the test with the A/C OFF.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Do not continuously run the test for 5 seconds or more.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Perform the test in a place with a high μ (coefficient of friction), such as on asphalt, so that the tires do not spin.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
<s2>
<ptxt>Apply the parking brake and chock the wheels.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), following the screen display, display the [ECU Data Monitor] screen and select [Engine Speed].</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Start the engine.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Firmly depress the brake pedal with your left foot, shift to the D position, fully depress the accelerator pedal with your right foot, and quickly read the highest engine speed.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Standard</title>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.37in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.37in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.34in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Engine Type</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Transmission Type</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Stall Speed [rpm]</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>2AZ-FE</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>K112</ptxt>
<ptxt>K112F</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>2450±150</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM000000FSU00TX_01_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___000047500000">
<ptxt>Hydraulic Test</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09843-18040</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Be sure to perform this after inspecting and adjusting the engine.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Perform the test at normal operating CVT fluid temperature (50 to 100°C).</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Perform the test with the A/C OFF.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Do not continuously run the test for 5 seconds or more.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Perform the test in a place with a high μ (coefficient of friction), such as on asphalt, so that the tires do not spin.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
<s2>
<ptxt>Apply the parking brake and chock the wheels.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), following the screen display, select [Active Test] → [TC Terminal ON], then select [ECU Data Monitor] → [AT Oil Pressure] and [Engine Speed].</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Firmly depress the brake pedal with your left foot, shift to the D or R position, and check the hydraulic pressure at stall speed.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Standard</title>
<table pgwide="1">
<title>Belt Clamping Pressure</title>
<tgroup cols="4" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.78in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.78in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.77in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="1.75in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Transaxle Type</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Engine Type)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Shift Position</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>At stall</ptxt>
<ptxt>Oil pressure</ptxt>
<ptxt>[MPa{kgf/cm<sup>2</sup>} ]</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>At stall</ptxt>
<ptxt>Engine Speed</ptxt>
<ptxt>[rpm</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle">
<ptxt>K112</ptxt>
<ptxt>K112F</ptxt>
<ptxt>(2AZ-FE)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>D Position</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>4.44 to 5.07</ptxt>
<ptxt>{45.3 to 51.7}</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle">
<ptxt>2450 ± 150</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>R position</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>3.08 to 3.90</ptxt>
<ptxt>{31.4 to 39.8}</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If the hydraulic pressure is above the maximum value or below the minimum value, the solenoid valves, regulator valve or modulator valve may be malfunctioning.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
<s-1 id="RM000000FSU00TX_01_0004" proc-id="RM0550J___000047600000">
<ptxt>Shift Diagram</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Be sure to perform this after inspecting and adjusting the engine.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Perform the test at normal operating CVT fluid temperature (50 to 100°C).</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Perform the test with no electrical load, the A/C OFF and the brake OFF.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Lock-up control is not performed when the CVT fluid temperature is 40°C or less and the vehicle speed is 60km/h or less, or when the CVT fluid temperature is 5°C or less.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Lock-up control is not performed when the engine coolant temperature is 30°C or less.   </ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>The lock-up OFF vehicle speed varies according to the ON/OFF status of the electrical load, A/C and brake. </ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
